message.content:
Build the complete Agency Hub for the Rankora project at /Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Rankora.

## What exists
- `src/pages/AgencyHub.tsx` — currently a placeholder with "Coming Soon" cards. MUST be fully rewritten.
- No hooks, no DB tables, no components exist for agency features.

## What to build

### Step 1: Create 5 hooks in `src/hooks/`

All hooks should use `(supabase as any)` pattern for queries since tables aren't in types.ts yet. Import supabase from `@/integrations/supabase/client`. Use `useQuery` and `useMutation` from `@tanstack/react-query`. All hooks take `teamId: string | null` as parameter.

**`src/hooks/useAgencyClients.ts`**
```ts
// Types
interface AgencyClient {
  id: string; team_id: string; company_name: string; industry: string | null;
  website: string | null; logo_url: string | null; sla_days: number | null;
  status: "active" | "inactive" | "churned"; notes: string | null; created_at: string;
}
interface AgencyContact {
  id: string; client_id: string; name: string; email: string | null;
  phone: string | null; role: string | null; is_primary: boolean; created_at: string;
}
// Exports: useAgencyClients(teamId) → { clients, isLoading, createClient, updateClient, deleteClient }
// Also: useAgencyContacts(clientId) → { contacts, isLoading, createContact, deleteContact }
```

**`src/hooks/useAgencyMandates.ts`**
```ts
interface AgencyMandate {
  id: string; client_id: string; team_id: string; job_title: string;
  description: string | null; priority: "high" | "medium" | "low";
  status: "open" | "in_progress" | "filled" | "cancelled";
  fee_type: "percentage" | "flat" | "retainer"; fee_amount: number | null;
  deadline: string | null; created_at: string;
  // Joined
  client_name?: string;
}
// Exports: useAgencyMandates(teamId) → { mandates, isLoading, createMandate, updateMandate }
```

**`src/hooks/useAgencyPlacements.ts`**
```ts
interface AgencyPlacement {
  id: string; mandate_id: string; client_id: string; candidate_name: string;
  candidate_email: string | null; status: "offered" | "accepted" | "started" | "guarantee" | "completed" | "fallen_off";
  start_date: string | null; salary: number | null; fee_amount: number | null;
  guarantee_days: number | null; guarantee_expires_at: string | null; created_at: string;
  // Joined
  client_name?: string; mandate_title?: string;
}
// Exports: useAgencyPlacements(teamId) → { placements, isLoading, createPlacement, updatePlacement }
```

**`src/hooks/useAgencyInvoices.ts`**
```ts
interface AgencyInvoice {
  id: string; placement_id: string | null; client_id: string; team_id: string;
  invoice_number: string; amount: number; currency: string;
  status: "draft" | "sent" | "paid" | "overdue"; due_date: string | null;
  paid_at: string | null; created_at: string;
  // Joined
  client_name?: string;
}
// Exports: useAgencyInvoices(teamId) → { invoices, isLoading, createInvoice, updateInvoice }
```

**`src/hooks/useAgencyCommissions.ts`**
```ts
interface AgencyCommission {
  id: string; placement_id: string; user_id: string; amount: number;
  percentage: number; status: "pending" | "approved" | "paid";
  period: string | null; created_at: string;
  // Joined
  candidate_name?: string; user_email?: string;
}
// Exports: useAgencyCommissions(teamId) → { commissions, isLoading, totals: { earned, pending, paid } }
```

### Step 2: Rewrite `src/pages/AgencyHub.tsx`

Read the current file first, then FULLY rewrite it. Use these imports:
- SidebarLayout, Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle, Button, Input, Label, Badge, Skeleton, Tabs, TabsList, TabsTrigger, TabsContent
- Dialog, DialogContent, DialogHeader, DialogTitle, DialogFooter
- Table, TableBody, TableCell, TableHead, TableHeader, TableRow
- Select, SelectContent, SelectItem, SelectTrigger, SelectValue
- Textarea
- All 5 hooks
- useTeam, useAuth
- Lucide icons as needed
- toast from sonner
- format from date-fns

**Page structure:**
```
SidebarLayout
  <main className="w-full px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 py-8">
    Header: "Agency Hub" title + stats badges
    <Tabs defaultValue="clients">
      Tab triggers with icons (matching CareerSettings underline style)

      Tab 1: Clients — table + Add Client dialog + inline edit
      Tab 2: Mandates — table + Add Mandate dialog (select client dropdown)
      Tab 3: Placements — table + Add Placement dialog (select mandate dropdown)
      Tab 4: Invoicing — table + Generate Invoice dialog + mark paid
      Tab 5: Commission — summary cards + table
    </Tabs>
  </main>
```

**Tab 1: Client Management**
- Stats row: active clients count, total mandates, total placements
- Search input + status filter
- Table: Company Name, Industry, Status badge, SLA Days, Active Mandates, Created, Actions (edit/delete)
- Add Client dialog: company_name (required), industry, website, sla_days, notes
- Empty state when no clients

**Tab 2: Mandates**
- Filter by status
- Table: Job Title, Client Name, Priority badge, Status badge, Fee, Deadline, Created
- Add Mandate dialog: select client (dropdown), job_title, description, priority, fee_type, fee_amount, deadline
- Status update dropdown inline

**Tab 3: Placements**
- Table: Candidate, Client, Mandate, Status badge, Start Date, Salary, Fee, Guarantee Expires
- Add Placement dialog: select mandate (dropdown), candidate_name, candidate_email, salary, fee_amount, start_date, guarantee_days
- Guarantee expiry visual (days remaining, red if <7)

**Tab 4: Invoicing**
- Summary cards: total invoiced, paid, overdue
- Table: Invoice #, Client, Amount, Status badge, Due Date, Paid Date, Actions (mark paid, send reminder)
- Generate Invoice dialog: select placement or client, amount, currency, due_date
- Export CSV button

**Tab 5: Commission**
- Summary cards: total earned, pending, paid (this month)
- Table: Candidate, Placement Fee, Commission %, Amount, Status, Period
- Period filter (select month)

**UI standards:**
- Cards: `border border-border/60 shadow-sm`
- Tables: `hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors` on rows
- Badges: use shadcn Badge variants (success for active/paid, destructive for overdue/churned, secondary for pending)
- Tab style: underline with icons (same as CareerSettings)
- Dialogs: standard shadcn Dialog with form fields
- Empty states: centered icon + text
- Loading: Skeleton rows

**IMPORTANT:**
- ALL queries use `(supabase as any).from("table_name")` pattern
- Handle errors gracefully with try/catch + toast
- Each mutation invalidates its query
- Export types from hooks so the page can use them
- The page should NOT crash if tables don't exist yet — wrap queries in try/catch

After writing all files, run: `cd "/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Rankora" && npm run build`
Fix any TypeScript errors before finishing.

